sec.p:
To enable the scaling of the 14|15 platform, it is essential to develop fast interconnects between quantum processing nodes without compromising performance23. The coupling of spin qubits is achievable by various mechanisms, such as dipolar interaction24 or spin–photon conversion in superconducting cavities25. The fastest coupling mechanism is provided by exchange interaction, as demonstrated with a 0.8-ns \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
